I usually go to school at eight in the morning, because there is a class at eight fifteen. I have three classes in the morning and two classes in the afternoon. My favorite class is English, because the English teacher is very friendly and her class is very interesting. I also like sports. When I have free time, I will play basketball with my classmates. I think the time in school is very fast, because we all have a good time.
